    "chunk_text": "es geleafan. AP28A1 On \u00f0one eahta ond twenteg\u00f0an d\u00e6g \u00f0\u00e6s mon\u00f0es bi\u00f0 sancte Vitales tid \u00fe\u00e6s martyres, se AP28A3 Se w\u00e6s \u00e6rest caseres c\u00e6mpa under Paulino \u00f0\u00e6m deman on Rauenna \u00f0\u00e6re ceastre, ac he \u00fea AP28A6 \u00dea yrsode se dema for\u00feon ond hine \u00fea nydde to deofolgylde begonge. AP28A8 \u00dea he \u00fe\u00e6t ne ge\u00feafode, \u00fea het se dema adelfan deopne sea\u00f0 ond hine cwicne on \u00f0one AP28A11 On \u00f0\u00e6re stowe w\u00e6ron oft si\u00f0\u00f0an heofonlico wundro. AP28B1 On \u00f0one ylcan d\u00e6g bi\u00f0 sancte Cristofores \u00f0rowung \u00fe\u00e6s miclan martyres. AP28B2 Se com on Decies dagum \u00fe\u00e6s caseres on \u00f0a ceastre \u00fee Samo is nemned of \u00fe\u00e6re \u00feeode \u00fe\u00e6r AP28B6 He h\u00e6fde hundes heafod, ond his loccas w\u00e6ron ofer gemet side, ond his eagan scinon swa AP28B9 He w\u00e6s gode geleaffull on his heortan, ac he ne mihte sprecan swa mon. AP28B11 \u00d0a b\u00e6d he god \u00f0\u00e6t he him sealde monnes gesprec. AP28B12 \u00d0a stod him \u00e6t sum wer on hwitum gegirelan ond e\u00f0ode him on \u00f0one mu\u00f0. AP28B13 \u00d0a mihte he si\u00f0\u00f0an sprecan swa mon. AP28B14 \u00d0a s\u00e6nde se casere twa hund c\u00e6mpena \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fea hine gel\u00e6ddan to him. AP28B16 Gif he \u00feonne nolde to him cuman, \u00fe\u00e6t hi hine ofslogon ond him brohtan \u00fe\u00e6t heafod to \u00fe\u00e6t AP28B",
